Appending to a key that holds a scalar value exits 1 with an error naming the key.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
count: 5
---
# Body

-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append count=6
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: cannot append to scalar key 'count' in plan.md
